close_reason: Direct callers refuse arrays for single-value extension flags; bare repeatable switches reach the handler as true; extension actions keep caller values
contract_change:
  api: "PmClient.run, runRegisteredCommandForTest and createExtensionTestHarness().runCommand for extension commands with declared flags; normalizeDirectExtensionCommandOptions"
  before: "An array passed to a flag that is not list/repeatable reached the handler ([] and [true] for a strict boolean, [1,2] for a number); PmClient.run joined a tags array to CSV and promoted a scalar dep, comment, file or test to an array for extension actions; a bare repeatable boolean switch reached the handler as [] on the CLI"
  after: An array for a single-value flag is refused with extension_flag_value_invalid (flag field) before the handler runs; extension actions keep the caller values and their declared contract normalizes them; each bare occurrence of a repeatable switch is true; a raw repeatable declaration counts as list
  migrate: "Pass one value for a flag that is not list/repeatable, or declare it with list: true or repeatable: true; handlers that read a scalar declared flag from PmClient.run no longer receive an array"
